Third-party code redistributed with this project
------------------------------------------------

winit 0.30.13 — https://github.com/rust-windowing/winit
Copyright the winit contributors, licensed under the Apache License 2.0.

A patched copy is vendored at forge-ide/vendor/winit-0.30.13/ and built in
place of the published crate. One file is modified —
src/platform_impl/macos/window_delegate.rs — so that macOS drag-and-drop
accepts the modern `NSPasteboardTypeFileURL` pasteboard format and not only
the legacy `NSFilenamesPboardType`; without it, dragging the thumbnail macOS
shows after a screenshot is refused. That file carries the modification notice
Apache 2.0 section 4(b) requires, and winit's own LICENSE is retained beside
the source it covers.

No other third-party source is redistributed here. Everything else is fetched
by Cargo at build time under its own licence.
